# Triage: external review 1 (codex gpt-6-astra, low), 20 Oktober 2026

Scope: 2a and 2d plus reference list. Findings in `review-findings.md`, prompt in `review-prompt.md`, run log in `review-run.log` (exit 0).

| # | Finding | Verdict | Evidence | Section |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Novelty claim ignores Hossain et al. (2024) | Valid | Hossain transcript PDF p. 22: awareness of time spent on SM is a cue that "snapped them out of procrastination". P13: TikTok covers the clock, "suddenly you've spent half an hour". So the overrun moment is partly documented. What Hossain does not follow is the decision to keep scrolling after that awareness. "belum tercakup" in 2d manfaat is too strong. "paling sedikit dipahami" in 2a para 4 is the writer's framing, defensible but safer softened. | 2d (main), 2a para 4 (optional) |
| 2 | Tran homework quote is a different kind of awareness | Valid | Ledger S11 itself records "menyadari tidak ingin kembali ke tugas rumah", which is not awareness of elapsed time (S10). 2a para 4 bridges them with "kesadaran itu tidak selalu diikuti penghentian". | 2a para 4 |
| 3 | TikTok or Instagram Reels is an example, not a boundary | Valid, minor | 2a ledger focus names both platforms. 2d tujuan says "misalnya membuka TikTok atau Instagram Reels". Reels-inside-Instagram point is subjective. | 2d tujuan |
| 4 | BPS 72,78% lacks age and reference period | Valid, minor | BPS transcript notes: ICT coverage is individuals aged 5 and over, reference period is the past three months. BPS itself phrases the figure as "penduduk Indonesia", so this is precision, not an error. | 2a para 1 |
| 5 | Rixen reference missing Article 228 | Valid | Rixen transcript p. 1: "Vol. 7, No. MHCI, Article 228". Same likely applies to Hossain (PACMHCI 8, CSCW1), but the retained copy is the preprint ("Article XXX"), Crossref has no article number, and ACM DL blocks fetch. Hossain's number is needs-user-copy. | References |
| 6 | Manfaat repeats the 2a gap | Subjective preference | Suji kept the repetition knowingly at acceptance. Rewriting for #1 is the natural moment to shorten it. | 2d manfaat |

Reference ratios: reviewer reports all 10 within ten years and 9 of 10 primary when the BPS and APJII reports count as primary. No action until 2b and 2c are added.

